WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:06.375
Washimi?

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:08.500
I'm going to sleep now.

00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:12.041
Isn't it freezing out there?
You'll catch a cold.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.125
Marriage is nothing to aspire to.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:20.791
You get hitched and then fall out of love
before you know it.

00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:25.125
Do you want to live your life
lying to yourself?

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:27.791
What's got into you?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.750
I'm saying that selfish aspirations
hurt you in the end.

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:35.541
What's wrong with having a dream?

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.041
And who are you to preach?

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:41.166
You can't know that
until you get married, right?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.750
I did, actually.

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:49.375
Huh?

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:52.541
I know what it's like.

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:54.125
You do?

00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:55.416
Yes.

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:59.791
I was married for all of four months.

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.541
How did I not know this?

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.500
I never told you.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.833
You should have! Aren't we friends?

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.041
I didn't feel the need to.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.041
Then why tell me now?

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:21.125
Don't get offended.

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:24.708
I doubt marriage would suit you, Gori.

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:30.916
I'm not deluding myself concerning that.

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.166
But are you really one to talk?

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.541
Wasn't your marriage a mistake?

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:41.416
What? Mistake?

00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:43.916
What are you talking about?

00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:47.666
After the divorce,
I was finally able to understand myself.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.958
I look back on it
as a learning experience.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.583
OK, I'll rephrase that.

00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:57.583
I'm not interested in the lectures
of a "proud divorcée!"

00:01:58.375 --> 00:01:59.833
What are you getting at?

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:03.250
I'm saying that I'm sick
of your anecdotal "advice."

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:05.333
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.625
Let's not spoil a perfectly good vacation!

00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:09.750
See? Look! Look at this!

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.291
Look at this!

00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.625
You're too old to play the "cool girl."

00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:16.416
It was just giving you advice,
nothing more.

